// Vitest Snapshot v1, https://vitest.dev/guide/snapshot.html

exports[`renders a family search form as recorded 1`] = `
"<form class="space-y-4 variant-search-workspace"><div class="variant-search-header"><div class="variant-search-meta"><div class="variant-search-toolbar"><button type="submit" class="form-button">Apply filters</button><select aria-label="Preset or saved search" class="variant-preset-select"><option value="">Preset or saved search</option><optgroup label="Built-in presets"><option value="built-in:phenotype_priority">Phenotype priority (Exomiser-style)</option><option value="built-in:dominant_strict">Dominant strict</option><option value="built-in:dominant_relaxed">Dominant relaxed</option><option value="built-in:expanded_carrier_screening">Expanded carrier screening</option><option value="built-in:compound_het">Compound het</option><option value="built-in:recessive_hom">Recessive hom</option><option value="built-in:recessive_permissive">Recessive broad</option><option value="built-in:any_affected">Any affected</option><option value="built-in:clinvar_review">ClinVar review</option></optgroup></select><button type="button" class="button-secondary">Save current</button><button type="button" class="button-secondary">Clear all filters</button></div><p class="variant-active-preset variant-active-preset--none" role="status" aria-live="polite"><span class="variant-active-preset-key">Active filter:</span> <span class="variant-active-preset-name">custom (no preset loaded)</span></p></div></div><section class="variant-search-section"><div class="variant-filter-dropdown-grid"><details class="variant-filter-dropdown"><summary class="variant-filter-dropdown-summary"><span class="variant-filter-dropdown-summary-copy"><span class="variant-filter-dropdown-title">Phenotype</span><span class="variant-filter-dropdown-meta">Prioritization off</span></span><span class="variant-filter-dropdown-summary-controls" role="presentation"><label class="analysis-checkbox"><input type="checkbox"><span>Phenotype prioritization</span></label></span><span class="variant-filter-dropdown-caret" aria-hidden="true">▾</span></summary><div class="variant-filter-dropdown-content"><p class="table-subtle">Rank candidate variants by how well each gene matches the affected individuals’ HPO phenotypes (Monarch / Exomiser-style).</p></div></details><details class="variant-filter-dropdown"><summary class="variant-filter-dropdown-summary"><span class="variant-filter-dropdown-summary-copy"><span class="variant-filter-dropdown-title">Structural second hit</span><span class="variant-filter-dropdown-meta">Off</span></span><span class="variant-filter-dropdown-summary-controls" role="presentation"><label class="analysis-checkbox"><input type="checkbox"><span>Also hit by an SV</span></label></span><span class="variant-filter-dropdown-caret" aria-hidden="true">▾</span></summary><div class="variant-filter-dropdown-content"><p class="table-subtle">Restrict to variants whose gene is also hit by a structural variant — the cross-type “second hit” (e.g. an SNV plus an overlapping deletion). Matches are tagged with the SV type and a trans/cis phase badge.</p></div></details><details class="variant-filter-dropdown"><summary class="variant-filter-dropdown-summary"><span class="variant-filter-dropdown-summary-copy"><span class="variant-filter-dropdown-title">Inheritance</span><span class="variant-filter-dropdown-meta">2 active</span></span><span class="variant-filter-dropdown-summary-controls" role="presentation"><label class="variant-summary-select-field"><span>Inheritance model</span><select aria-label="Quick inheritance"><option value="all">All</option><option value="de_novo_dominant">De novo/dominant</option><option value="recessive_homozygous">Recessive homozygous</option><option value="compound_het">Compound heterozygous</option><option value="x_linked">X-linked</option><option value="custom">Custom</option></select></label></span><span class="variant-filter-dropdown-caret" aria-hidden="true">▾</span></summary><div class="variant-filter-dropdown-content"><label class="analysis-checkbox"><input type="checkbox">Couple-based expanded carrier screening</label><p class="table-subtle">Restricts results to genes where both MOM and DAD carry a variant, and to variants a female partner carries on chrX outside the pseudo-autosomal regions: for an X-linked condition her carrier status alone puts a son at risk. A partner whose sex is not recorded counts as female.</p><div class="variant-sample-grid"><div class="variant-sample-row"><div class="variant-sample-heading"><span class="variant-sample-title">♂ PROBAND</span><div class="variant-sample-meta"><span class="table-chip">proband</span><span class="table-chip badge-chip--signature">affected</span></div></div><div class="variant-sample-controls"><div class="variant-gt-toggle-row"><label class="analysis-checkbox" title="Homozygous alt, including hemizygous/haploid calls (1) and 2/2 at multi-allelic sites"><input type="checkbox">Hom</label><label class="analysis-checkbox" title="Heterozygous, including multi-allelic calls such as 1/2 and half calls such as ./1"><input type="checkbox">Het</label><label class="analysis-checkbox" title="Reference, including haploid 0, no-calls and samples without a call at the site"><input type="checkbox">WT</label></div></div></div><div class="variant-sample-row"><div class="variant-sample-heading"><span class="variant-sample-title">♀ MOM</span><div class="variant-sample-meta"><span class="table-chip">mother</span><span class="table-chip ">unaffected</span></div></div><div class="variant-sample-controls"><div class="variant-gt-toggle-row"><label class="analysis-checkbox" title="Homozygous alt, including hemizygous/haploid calls (1) and 2/2 at multi-allelic sites"><input type="checkbox">Hom</label><label class="analysis-checkbox" title="Heterozygous, including multi-allelic calls such as 1/2 and half calls such as ./1"><input type="checkbox">Het</label><label class="analysis-checkbox" title="Reference, including haploid 0, no-calls and samples without a call at the site"><input type="checkbox">WT</label></div></div></div><div class="variant-sample-row"><div class="variant-sample-heading"><span class="variant-sample-title">♂ DAD</span><div class="variant-sample-meta"><span class="table-chip">father</span><span class="table-chip ">unaffected</span></div></div><div class="variant-sample-controls"><div class="variant-gt-toggle-row"><label class="analysis-checkbox" title="Homozygous alt, including hemizygous/haploid calls (1) and 2/2 at multi-allelic sites"><input type="checkbox">Hom</label><label class="analysis-checkbox" title="Heterozygous, including multi-allelic calls such as 1/2 and half calls such as ./1"><input type="checkbox">Het</label><label class="analysis-checkbox" title="Reference, including haploid 0, no-calls and samples without a call at the site"><input type="checkbox">WT</label></div></div></div></div><div class="analysis-filter-grid analysis-filter-grid--3"><div><p class="variant-annotation-impact-title">Any variant type</p><div class="variant-checkbox-grid variant-checkbox-grid--compact"><label class="analysis-checkbox variant-compact-checkbox"><input type="checkbox">SNV</label><label class="analysis-checkbox variant-compact-checkbox"><input type="checkbox">INDEL</label><label class="analysis-checkbox variant-compact-checkbox"><input type="checkbox">MNV</label></div></div><input placeholder="Callset / source" value="" name="source"><input placeholder="Phase set" value="" name="ps"></div></div></details><details class="variant-filter-dropdown"><summary class="variant-filter-dropdown-summary"><span class="variant-filter-dropdown-summary-copy"><span class="variant-filter-dropdown-title">Pathogenicity</span><span class="variant-filter-dropdown-meta">1 active</span></span><span class="variant-filter-dropdown-summary-controls" role="presentation"><label class="variant-summary-select-field"><span>Quick</span><select aria-label="Quick pathogenicity"><option value="all">All</option><option value="path_likely_path">P/LP</option><option value="not_benign">Not benign</option><option value="custom">Custom</option></select></label></span><span class="variant-filter-dropdown-caret" aria-hidden="true">▾</span></summary><div class="variant-filter-dropdown-content"><p class="variant-annotation-impact-title">ClinVar status</p><div class="variant-checkbox-grid variant-checkbox-grid--small"><label class="analysis-checkbox variant-compact-checkbox"><input type="checkbox" checked="">Pathogenic</label><label class="analysis-checkbox variant-compact-checkbox"><input type="checkbox">Likely pathogenic</label><label class="analysis-checkbox variant-compact-checkbox"><input type="checkbox">Uncertain significance</label><label class="analysis-checkbox variant-compact-checkbox"><input type="checkbox">Likely benign</label><label class="analysis-checkbox variant-compact-checkbox"><input type="checkbox">Benign</label><label class="analysis-checkbox variant-compact-checkbox"><input type="checkbox">Conflicting classifications</label></div></div></details><details class="variant-filter-dropdown"><summary class="variant-filter-dropdown-summary"><span class="variant-filter-dropdown-summary-copy"><span class="variant-filter-dropdown-title">Annotations</span><span class="variant-filter-dropdown-meta">1 active</span></span><span class="variant-filter-dropdown-summary-controls" role="presentation"><label class="variant-summary-select-field"><span>Quick</span><select aria-label="Quick annotations"><option value="all">All</option><option value="high_impact">High impact</option><option value="moderate_to_high">Moderate to high impact</option><option value="all_coding">All coding</option><option value="custom">Custom</option></select></label></span><span class="variant-filter-dropdown-caret" aria-hidden="true">▾</span></summary><div class="variant-filter-dropdown-content"><p class="variant-filter-section-note">A variant is kept when one of its transcripts has any of the ticked consequences or VEP impacts, or reaches the SpliceAI minimum. The transcript filters and the identifiers below must hold on that same transcript.</p><div class="variant-annotation-layout"><div class="variant-annotation-row"><div class="variant-annotation-group" role="group" aria-label="Nonsense"><label class="analysis-checkbox variant-annotation-group-title"><input aria-label="Nonsense (whole group)" type="checkbox">Nonsense</label><div class="variant-annotation-options"><span class="variant-annotation-option"><label class="analysis-checkbox variant-compact-checkbox"><input type="checkbox">Stop gained</label><span class="info-icon" tabindex="0"><span aria-hidden="true">i</span><span class="sr-only">About Stop gained</span></span></span></div></div><div class="variant-annotation-group" role="group" aria-label="Essential splice site"><label class="analysis-checkbox variant-annotation-group-title"><input aria-label="Essential splice site (whole group)" type="checkbox">Essential splice site</label><div class="variant-annotation-options"><span class="variant-annotation-option"><label class="analysis-checkbox variant-compact-checkbox"><input type="checkbox">Splice donor variant</label><span class="info-icon" tabindex="0"><span aria-hidden="true">i</span><span class="sr-only">About Splice donor variant</span></span></span><span class="variant-annotation-option"><label class="analysis-checkbox variant-compact-checkbox"><input type="checkbox">Splice acceptor variant</label><span class="info-icon" tabindex="0"><span aria-hidden="true">i</span><span class="sr-only">About Splice acceptor variant</span></span></span></div></div><div class="variant-annotation-group" role="group" aria-label="Frameshift"><label class="analysis-checkbox variant-annotation-group-title"><input aria-label="Frameshift (whole group)" type="checkbox">Frameshift</label><div class="variant-annotation-options"><span class="variant-annotation-option"><label class="analysis-checkbox variant-compact-checkbox"><input type="checkbox">Frameshift</label><span class="info-icon" tabindex="0"><span aria-hidden="true">i</span><span class="sr-only">About Frameshift</span></span></span></div></div><div class="variant-annotation-group" role="group" aria-label="Missense"><label class="analysis-checkbox variant-annotation-group-title"><input aria-label="Missense (whole group)" type="checkbox">Missense</label><div class="variant-annotation-options"><span class="variant-annotation-option"><label class="analysis-checkbox variant-compact-checkbox"><input type="checkbox">Stop lost</label><span class="info-icon" tabindex="0"><span aria-hidden="true">i</span><span class="sr-only">About Stop lost</span></span></span><span class="variant-annotation-option"><label class="analysis-checkbox variant-compact-checkbox"><input type="checkbox">Start lost</label><span class="info-icon" tabindex="0"><span aria-hidden="true">i</span><span class="sr-only">About Start lost</span></span></span><span class="variant-annotation-option"><label class="analysis-checkbox variant-compact-checkbox"><input type="checkbox">Protein altering</label><span class="info-icon" tabindex="0"><span aria-hidden="true">i</span><span class="sr-only">About Protein altering</span></span></span><span class="variant-annotation-option"><label class="analysis-checkbox variant-compact-checkbox"><input type="checkbox">Missense</label><span class="info-icon" tabindex="0"><span aria-hidden="true">i</span><span class="sr-only">About Missense</span></span></span></div></div><div class="variant-annotation-group" role="group" aria-label="In frame"><label class="analysis-checkbox variant-annotation-group-title"><input aria-label="In frame (whole group)" type="checkbox">In frame</label><div class="variant-annotation-options"><span class="variant-annotation-option"><label class="analysis-checkbox variant-compact-checkbox"><input type="checkbox">In-frame insertion</label><span class="info-icon" tabindex="0"><span aria-hidden="true">i</span><span class="sr-only">About In-frame insertion</span></span></span><span class="variant-annotation-option"><label class="analysis-checkbox variant-compact-checkbox"><input type="checkbox">In-frame deletion</label><span class="info-icon" tabindex="0"><span aria-hidden="true">i</span><span class="sr-only">About In-frame deletion</span></span></span></div></div></div><div class="variant-annotation-row"><div class="variant-annotation-group" role="group" aria-label="Synonymous"><label class="analysis-checkbox variant-annotation-group-title"><input aria-label="Synonymous (whole group)" type="checkbox">Synonymous</label><div class="variant-annotation-options"><span class="variant-annotation-option"><label class="analysis-checkbox variant-compact-checkbox"><input type="checkbox">Synonymous</label><span class="info-icon" tabindex="0"><span aria-hidden="true">i</span><span class="sr-only">About Synonymous</span></span></span><span class="variant-annotation-option"><label class="analysis-checkbox variant-compact-checkbox"><input type="checkbox">Start retained</label><span class="info-icon" tabindex="0"><span aria-hidden="true">i</span><span class="sr-only">About Start retained</span></span></span><span class="variant-annotation-option"><label class="analysis-checkbox variant-compact-checkbox"><input type="checkbox">Stop retained</label><span class="info-icon" tabindex="0"><span aria-hidden="true">i</span><span class="sr-only">About Stop retained</span></span></span></div></div><div class="variant-annotation-group" role="group" aria-label="Extended splice site"><label class="analysis-checkbox variant-annotation-group-title"><input aria-label="Extended splice site (whole group)" type="checkbox">Extended splice site</label><div class="variant-annotation-options"><span class="variant-annotation-option"><label class="analysis-checkbox variant-compact-checkbox"><input type="checkbox">Splice donor 5th base</label><span class="info-icon" tabindex="0"><span aria-hidden="true">i</span><span class="sr-only">About Splice donor 5th base</span></span></span><span class="variant-annotation-option"><label class="analysis-checkbox variant-compact-checkbox"><input type="checkbox">Splice region</label><span class="info-icon" tabindex="0"><span aria-hidden="true">i</span><span class="sr-only">About Splice region</span></span></span><span class="variant-annotation-option"><label class="analysis-checkbox variant-compact-checkbox"><input type="checkbox">Splice donor region</label><span class="info-icon" tabindex="0"><span aria-hidden="true">i</span><span class="sr-only">About Splice donor region</span></span></span><span class="variant-annotation-option"><label class="analysis-checkbox variant-compact-checkbox"><input type="checkbox">Splice polypyrimidine tract</label><span class="info-icon" tabindex="0"><span aria-hidden="true">i</span><span class="sr-only">About Splice polypyrimidine tract</span></span></span><span class="variant-annotation-option"><label class="analysis-checkbox variant-compact-checkbox"><input type="checkbox">Extended intronic splice region</label><span class="info-icon" tabindex="0"><span aria-hidden="true">i</span><span class="sr-only">About Extended intronic splice region</span></span></span></div></div><div class="variant-annotation-group variant-annotation-group--wide" role="group" aria-label="Other"><label class="analysis-checkbox variant-annotation-group-title"><input aria-label="Other (whole group)" type="checkbox">Other</label><div class="variant-annotation-options"><span class="variant-annotation-option"><label class="analysis-checkbox variant-compact-checkbox"><input type="checkbox">Transcript ablation</label><span class="info-icon" tabindex="0"><span aria-hidden="true">i</span><span class="sr-only">About Transcript ablation</span></span></span><span class="variant-annotation-option"><label class="analysis-checkbox variant-compact-checkbox"><input type="checkbox">Incomplete terminal codon variant</label><span class="info-icon" tabindex="0"><span aria-hidden="true">i</span><span class="sr-only">