ype="checkbox">Likely pathogenic - class 4</label></div></div><div><p class="variant-annotation-impact-title">Excluded custom tags</p><p class="table-subtle">No custom tags available.</p></div></div><textarea name="exclude_gene" rows="3" placeholder="Excluded genes: TTN
