><span class="sr-only">About Extended intronic splice region</span></span></span></div></div><div class="variant-annotation-group variant-annotation-group--wide" role="group" aria-label="Other"><label class="analysis-checkbox variant-annotation-group-title"><input aria-label="Other (whole group)" type="checkbox">Other</label><div class="variant-annotation-options"><span class="variant-annotation-option"><label class="analysis-checkbox variant-compact-checkbox"><input type="checkbox">Transcript ablation</label><span class="info-icon" tabindex="0"><span aria-hidden="true">i</span><span class="sr-only">About Transcript ablation</span></span></span><span class="variant-annotation-option"><label class="analysis-checkbox variant-compact-checkbox"><input type="checkbox">Incomplete terminal codon variant</label><span class="info-icon" tabindex="0"><span aria-hidden="true">i</span><span class="sr-only">About Incomplete terminal codon variant</span></span></span><span class="variant-annotation-option"><label class="analysis-checkbox variant-compact-checkbox"><input type="checkbox">Coding sequence variant</label><span class="info-icon" tabindex="0"><span aria-hidden="true">i</span><span class="sr-only">About Coding sequence variant</span></span></span><span class="variant-annotation-option"><label class="analysis-checkbox variant-compact-checkbox"><input type="checkbox">Mature miRNA variant</label><span class="info-icon" tabindex="0"><span aria-hidden="true">i</span><span class="sr-only">About Mature miRNA variant</span></span></span><span class="variant-annotation-option"><label class="analysis-checkbox variant-compact-checkbox"><input type="checkbox">5' UTR variant</label><span class="info-icon" tabindex="0"><span aria-hidden="true">i</span><span class="sr-only">About 5' UTR variant</span></span></span><span class="variant-annotation-option"><label class="analysis-checkbox variant-compact-checkbox"><input type="checkbox">3' UTR variant</label><span class="info-icon" tabindex