></div></details><details class="variant-filter-dropdown"><summary class="variant-filter-dropdown-summary"><span class="variant-filter-dropdown-summary-copy"><span class="variant-filter-dropdown-title">In silico</span><span class="variant-filter-dropdown-meta">1 active</span></span><span class="variant-filter-dropdown-caret" aria-hidden="true">▾</span></summary><div class="variant-filter-dropdown-content"><div class="analysis-filter-grid analysis-filter-grid--5"><input placeholder="CADD ≥" value="20" name="min_cadd"><input placeholder="REVEL ≥" value="" name="min_revel"></div><div class="variant-inline-controls"><div><p class="variant-annotation-impact-title">SIFT</p><div class="variant-checkbox-grid variant-checkbox-grid--small"><label class="analysis-checkbox variant-compact-checkbox"><input type="checkbox">deleterious</label><label class="analysis-checkbox variant-compact-checkbox"><input type="checkbox">deleterious low confidence</label><label class="analysis-checkbox variant-compact-checkbox"><input type="checkbox">tolerated</label></div></div><div><p class="variant-annotation-impact-title">PolyPhen</p><div class="variant-checkbox-grid variant-checkbox-grid--small"><label class="analysis-checkbox variant-compact-checkbox"><input type="checkbox">probably damaging</label><label class="analysis-checkbox variant-compact-checkbox"><input type="checkbox">possibly damaging</label><label class="analysis-checkbox variant-compact-checkbox"><input type="checkbox">benign</label></div></div></div><p class="table-subtle">Variants matching any selected predictor are returned. Numeric thresholds are interpreted as greater-than-or-equal filters. The SpliceAI minimum, set under Annotations, counts as one of these predictors too.</p></div></details><details class="variant-filter-dropdown"><summary class="variant-filter-dropdown-summary"><span class="variant-filter-dropdown-summary-copy"><span class="variant-filter-dropdown-title">Frequency</span><span class="variant-filter-dropdown-meta">1 active</span></span><span class="variant-filter-dropdown-summary-controls" role="presentation"><label class="variant-summary-select-field"><span>AF</span><select aria-label="Maximum AF, all populations"><option value="">Any</option><option value="0">0</option><option value="0.0001">0.0001</option><option value="0.0005">0.0005</option><option value="0.001">0.001</option><option value="0.005">0.005</option><option value="0.01">0.01</option><option value="0.02">0.02</option><option value="0.03">0.03</option><option value="0.04">0.04</option><option value="0.05">0.05</option><option value="0.1">0.1</option></select></label><label class="variant-summary-select-field variant-summary-input-field"><span>AC</span><input aria-label="Maximum gnomAD AC" inputmode="numeric" value="" name="max_gnomad_ac"></label><label class="variant-summary-select-field variant-summary-input-field"><span>H/H</span><input aria-label="Maximum gnomAD homozygotes and hemizygotes" inputmode="numeric" value=""></label></span><span class="variant-filter-dropdown-caret" aria-hidden="true">▾</span></summary><div class="variant-filter-dropdown-content"><p class="variant-filter-section-note">Filter on the allele frequency in each population (AF), and on gnomAD's allele count (AC) and homozygote and hemizygote counts (H/H). A variant a population lacks passes its maximum, as absent from it.</p><div class="variant-frequency-columns"><div class="variant-frequency-column"><span class="variant-filter-column-title">gnomAD genomes<span class="info-icon" tabindex="0"><span aria-hidden="true">i</span><span class="sr-only">About gnomAD genomes</span></span></span><div class="variant-step-slider" style="--slider-position: 1;"><span class="variant-step-slider-value" aria-hidden="true">1</span><input min="0" max="11" step="1" aria-label="gnomAD genomes maximum AF" aria-valuetext="1" type="range" value="11"><span class="variant-step-slider-ends" aria-hidden="true"><span>0</span><span>1</span></span></div></di