alance (AB, the share of reads with the alternate allele), depth (DP) and alternate-allele reads (AD). Set them here for the members at once, or per member below. Pass variants only keeps a variant when every call that carries it passed its caller's FILTER.</p><div class="variant-quality-columns"><div class="variant-quality-column"><span class="variant-filter-column-title">Affected only<span class="info-icon" tabindex="0"><span aria-hidden="true">i</span><span class="sr-only">About Affected only</span></span></span><label class="variant-switch"><input role="switch" aria-label="Affected only" type="checkbox" checked=""><span class="variant-switch-track" aria-hidden="true"></span></label></div><div class="variant-quality-column" role="radiogroup" aria-label="Filter value"><span class="variant-filter-column-title">Filter value<span class="info-icon" tabindex="0"><span aria-hidden="true">i</span><span class="sr-only">About Filter value</span></span></span><div class="variant-radio-options"><label class="analysis-checkbox"><input type="radio" checked="" name="pass_only">Show all variants</label><label class="analysis-checkbox"><input type="radio" name="pass_only">Pass variants only</label></div></div><div class="variant-quality-column"><span class="variant-filter-column-title">Genotype quality<span class="info-icon" tabindex="0"><span aria-hidden="true">i</span><span class="sr-only">About Genotype quality</span></span></span><div class="variant-step-slider" style="--slider-position: 0.2;"><span class="variant-step-slider-value" aria-hidden="true">20</span><input min="0" max="20" step="1" aria-label="Genotype quality minimum" aria-valuetext="20" type="range" value="4"><span class="variant-step-slider-ends" aria-hidden="true"><span>0</span><span>100</span></span></div></div><div class="variant-quality-column"><span class="variant-filter-column-title">Allele balance<span class="info-icon" tabindex="0"><span aria-hidden="true">i</span><span class="sr-only">About Allele balance</span></span></span><div class="variant-step-slider" style="--slider-position: 0;"><span class="variant-step-slider-value" aria-hidden="true">0%</span><input min="0" max="100" step="1" aria-label="Allele balance minimum" aria-valuetext="0%" type="range" value="0"><span class="variant-step-slider-ends" aria-hidden="true"><span>0%</span><span>100%</span></span></div></div><div class="variant-quality-column"><span class="variant-filter-column-title">Depth<span class="info-icon" tabindex="0"><span aria-hidden="true">i</span><span class="sr-only">About Depth</span></span></span><div class="variant-step-slider" style="--slider-position: 0.2;"><span class="variant-step-slider-value" aria-hidden="true">10</span><input min="0" max="50" step="1" aria-label="Depth minimum" aria-valuetext="10" type="range" value="10"><span class="variant-step-slider-ends" aria-hidden="true"><span>0</span><span>50</span></span></div></div><div class="variant-quality-column"><span class="variant-filter-column-title">Alt reads<span class="info-icon" tabindex="0"><span aria-hidden="true">i</span><span class="sr-only">About Alt reads</span></span></span><div class="variant-step-slider" style="--slider-position: 0;"><span class="variant-step-slider-value" aria-hidden="true">0</span><input min="0" max="20" step="1" aria-label="Alt reads minimum" aria-valuetext="0" type="range" value="0"><span class="variant-step-slider-ends" aria-hidden="true"><span>0</span><span>20</span></span></div></div></div><div class="variant-quality-table-shell"><table class="variant-quality-table"><thead><tr><th scope="col">Member</th><th scope="col">GQ ≥</th><th scope="col">AB ≥</th><th scope="col">DP ≥</th><th scope="col">AD alt ≥</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row"><span class="variant-sample-title">♂ PROBAND</span> <span class="table-chip">proband</span> <span class="table-chip badge-chip--signature">affected</span></th><td><input aria-label="PROBAND GQ ≥" inputmode="decimal" value="20"></td><td><input aria-lab